   horizontal padding from any ancestor — title, tabs, refresh button,
   search, and campaign/draft lists all sat flush against the viewport
   edge. Padding applied directly to the page container instead of adding
   a new wrapper div, using the same --orv-content-* variables every other
   workspace already uses (.orv-page-wrap, .prf-wrap, .ap-op-outer) so the
