/* No breakpoint existed for this at all (confirmed by direct grep before
   this fix) -- 3 fixed columns would just keep shrinking indefinitely.
   !important: body.dark-mode .bb-stat-grid sets grid-template-columns
   unconditionally (no media query) with !important -- a plain rule here
   would be defeated by it in dark mode. */
