/* ══ Master Dashboard Layout Pass — content-width fix ═════════════════
   #page-business-brain .orv-page-wrap's max-width rule (originally
   written near the rest of the .biz-* block, ~line 39287) never made it
   into the browser's parsed CSSOM — confirmed via a live check of
   document.styleSheets[].cssRules: every rule immediately before and
   after it parsed correctly, but that one rule was silently absent,
   and the page was rendering at the generic 1040px (--orv-content-maxw)
   instead of the intended --camp-content-maxw. The identical selector
   placed here, at the end of the file, parses and applies correctly, so
   the real fix lives here instead of chasing the one-off drop further. */
