/* Launch — inline credit-cost indicator next to the Build Campaign button.
   Appended at end of file per this codebase's established workaround for
   rules silently dropping from parsed CSSOM when inserted into dense
   original regions -- see prior fixes in this file for the same note.

   Anchored bottom-right of the composer footer: .cr2-gen-row previously
   had no explicit `order`, so — sharing .cr2-box-foot's flex row with
